      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '1.<indent=6%>Find the four pills: <color=#7CD97C>green</color>, <color=#FF6B5E>red</color>,
    <color=#7FB0FF>blue</color> and <color=#D19A62>brown</color>.</indent>

    2.<indent=6%>A
    pill opens every door of the same colour.</indent>

    3.<indent=6%>When you
    have all four pills, find the exit.</indent>

    4.<indent=6%>Do not let the
    ghosts see you.</indent>

    5.<indent=6%>If a ghost catches you, you lose your
    pills and start again in this room.</indent>


    The timer starts when you
    go through the door out of this room. The fastest times are on the BEST ESCAPE
    TIMES board.'
